### Submit a card rating (collector-api)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardId": "CHARIZARD_BASE_SET",
  "userId": "user-01",
  "score": 5,
  "tags": ["FIRE", "HOLO", "VINTAGE"],
  "experience": "Centerpiece card for a vintage fire collection."
}

### Submit another quick rating for the same card (used in debugging exercise)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/ratings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardId": "CHARIZARD_BASE_SET",
  "userId": "user-02",
  "score": 2,
  "tags": ["FIRE", "VINTAGE"],
  "experience": "The card is iconic, but this copy had rough edges."
}

### Get tag-based suggestions (advisor-api)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/suggestions?tags=FIRE&tags=HOLO&tags=VINTAGE
Accept: application/json
